  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.lFVqejlf52cdYrZy]{Munitions Crafter} feat. If you learn the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.xWY5omyIcILNR7y1]{Magical Crafting} feat, you can craft magical ammunition or ether batteries (such as those used for sygican weapons, tech, or gadgets) but you will require a spellcaster to at least supply the magic needed to finish the crafting process. As normal, to activate magical ammunition yourself you require a sygican firearm. </span>You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.meE4xdhhfBXFiAuK]{Resolute Reload} action.</p>"
